<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  English copy, and the default: Android falls back here for every device
  language that is not Hebrew. Hebrew lives in values-iw/.

  Voice: spoken English, second person, never a literal translation of the
  Hebrew. Position: willpower does not work, and Atzor does not ask for any.
  The copy and the mechanism have to back each other up, so nothing here may
  promise behavior the app does not actually implement.
  Never use em-dashes. Regular hyphens only.
-->
