    <!-- Guarded Settings screen notice -->
    <string name="notice_settings_guarded">This screen is locked while a lock is running, so Atzor cannot be switched off. The rest of Settings is open, including Bluetooth and Wi-Fi.\nReally need out? Hold the emergency button on the lock screen.</string>

    <!-- Strict mode confirmation -->
    <string name="strict_confirm_title">Before you turn this on</string>
    <string name="strict_confirm_body">While a lock is running you will not be able to switch Atzor off or uninstall it. The only early way out is the emergency unlock, which you open by holding a button for five seconds.\n\nThe rest of Settings stays open, including Bluetooth and Wi-Fi. Note that on some devices the block is not perfect, so this makes backing out hard rather than impossible.</string>
