    <string name="tip_open_body">Locked for a set time? Tap \"Open\" on the home screen. Locked until a tag/code? Hold the tag or scan the QR. Emergency: hold the unlock button for five seconds.</string>
    <string name="tip_shabbat_title">A digital day of rest, midweek too</string>
