    <string name="tip_bt_title">Your car\'s Bluetooth</string>
    <string name="tip_bt_body">Atzor can lock automatically when the car connects. Only devices you marked under \"How you open it\", never on any Bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="tip_emergency_title">Emergency release</string>
    <string name="tip_emergency_body">If you truly need out: press and hold the emergency button for five seconds. Long enough that you cannot do it by accident, short enough that a real emergency is never a problem.</string>

